{"_v":1,"id":"summerfolk-west-end-2026","cat":"west-end","cs":73,"rc":12,"bd":{"positive":7,"mixed":4,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Nick Curtis","o":"Evening Standard","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/summerfolk-review-national-theatre-b1275409.html","d":"2026-03-18","q":"But overall this handsomely cast and mounted show reminded me of the work the late, great Howard Davies used to present in the Olivier: and that is a high compliment indeed."},{"cn":"Dominic Cavendish","o":"The Telegraph","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/theatre/what-to-see/summerfolk-national-theatre-review/","d":"2026-03-18","q":"Caveats aside, do catch it; it'll be a generation before it's back."},{"cn":"Arifa Akbar","o":"The Guardian","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2026/mar/18/summerfolk-review-gorky","d":"2026-03-18","q":"This goes on a little too long as well, although it is likable enough."},{"cn":"Anya Ryan","o":"London Theatre","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/summerfolk-review-national-theatre","d":"2026-03-18","q":"At its centre lies a pressing question: does anything really matter when the world is falling apart?"},{"cn":"Tim Bano","o":"Financial Times","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.ft.com/content/181bc1e8-ca51-4f51-9544-148a15c547f0","d":"2026-03-18","q":"It's a glorious final swell of a vast production, which sets the sun on these summerfolk."},{"cn":"Sarah Crompton","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/summerfolk-at-the-national-theatre-review_1715495/","d":"2026-03-18","q":"His play speaks just as loudly to our careless times, even if it does so at considerable, sprawling length."},{"cn":"Alice Saville","o":"The Independent","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/reviews/summerfolk-national-theatre-review-gorky-b2940849.html","d":"2026-03-18","q":"Still, the best moments of Summerfolk shine out, strikingly modern."},{"cn":"Andrzej Lukowski","o":"Time Out London","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/summerfolk-review","d":"2026-03-18","q":"So this is a generational production, really, and whatever its flaws are, they shouldn’t put you off seeing the sort of luxury revival that the NT was made for."},{"cn":"Gary Naylor","o":"BroadwayWorld","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.broadwayworld.com/westend/article/Review-SUMMERFOLK-starring-Sophie-Rundle-National-Theatre-20260318","d":"2026-03-18","q":"It's hard to like any of this menagerie of misanthropes, but it's easy to be amused by them"},{"cn":"Unknown","o":"The Arts Desk","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.theartsdesk.com/theatre/summerfolk-national-theatre-review-gorkys-self-deluding-intelligentsia-under-sharp-comic-scrutiny","q":"Speed serves the comedy well under Robert Hastie"},{"cn":"Stuart King","o":"London Box Office","s":67,"b":"Mixed","t":3,"u":"https://www.londonboxoffice.co.uk/news/post/summerfolk-nt-review","d":"2026-03-18","q":"But does fresh equate to better?"},{"cn":"The Reviews Hub - London","o":"The Reviews Hub","s":49,"b":"Negative","t":3,"u":"https://www.thereviewshub.com/summerfolk-national-theatre-london/","d":"2026-03-18","q":"Yet the adaptation itself fails to conjure up any of the magic."}],"au":{"score":71,"designation":"Shrugging","sources":{"mz":{"s":67,"c":59,"sr":3.4},"rd":{"s":73,"c":11,"tp":7,"sent":{"enthusiastic":0.18,"positive":0.18,"mixed":0.27,"negative":0.18,"neutral":0.18}},"sp":{"s":78,"c":24,"sr":3.88},"lb":{"s":80,"c":6,"sr":4}}},"hi":"/images/shows/summerfolk-west-end-2026/hero.webp","pd":"2026-03-06"}